:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[JUPITER KING (Enemy)]].''
'''JUPITER KING''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] of [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] significantly increases health, adds a 100% chance to [[Barrier Breaker|break]] [[Barrier]]s, and adds a 100% chance to create a Lv.1 [[Surge Attack]].

