==Evolution==
Evolves into '''JUPITER KING CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''GOLDEN JUPITER CC''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
JUPITER KING's niche is to knockback and slow Aliens. It's a niche with some big benefits, but equally big weaknesses. On one hand, the niche allows it to hold back a trait that's pretty notorious for swarms. On the other hand, Aliens are a trait also brimming with backliners, in which its abilities can cause it to push too far and endanger your other units. It's a niche that should be self explanatory for his usage, but JUPITER KING's performance leaves a lot to be desired due to its low proc chances, long attack rate, and general lack of noteworthy abilities to justify how unimpressive it is. As such, if you need a unit to knockback or slow Aliens, [[Ancient Egg: N105 (Rare Cat)|Racquet Cat]] and [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] will be more than enough for the job.

JUPITER KING has good range and ok DPS, allowing it to be usable as a generalist, but its not highly ideal due to lacking mobility and survivability. As such, it gets outclassed by [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] very easily.

==='''True Form'''===
Through the guaranteed surge ability alone, GOLDEN JUPITER CC's usage skyrockets. To anything not Surge Immune, the unit's average 4.7k DPS turns into an incredible 9.4k. The surge itself is also very reliable, spawning at 700-400. This allows it to rank as a top generalist, being applicable in almost any scenario and delivering monstrous results in a similar vein to [[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Lord Gao]]. On top of that, it also gets a big health buff, somewhat compensating for its survivability, although care must be taken to avoid enemies from sniping it.

GOLDEN JUPITER CC crowd controlling doesn't change on its own, but the Surge can potentially reach enemies outranging it, which pairs well with its newfound Barrier Breaker ability, although it shouldn't be relied upon for CC due to its very slow attack rate.

Overall, GOLDEN JUPITER CC is a stellar unit, and is beyond worth all 7 Catfruits needed to obtain it.

